ah 11:10 refers to 'the root of Jesse standing as a sign for the peoples' in the messianic era.", :sources ["Mishnah Sanhedrin 10:3" "Sanhedrin 110b" "Sanhedrin 111a" "Isaiah 11:10" "Hosea 2:1"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["כמסרה" "ויהיו לנס" "שורש ישי אשר עומד לנס עמים" "שש ברקמה"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "כמסרה", :refs [], :n 0, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "ויהיו לנס", :refs ["Numbers 26:10"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "שורש ישי אשר עומד לנס עמים", :refs ["Isaiah 11:10"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "שש ברקמה", :refs ["Ezekiel 27:7"], :n 1, :lens :exact}]} {:kind :other, :note "Three Masorah listings expanded into five occurrences via phrase citation", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:31:46.186130840Z", :model "glm-5.2"}